sequenceDiagram
    %% SD3 - Prepare orders in the kitchen
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5
    %% Description: A kitchen employee sees all orders with their status, and sees each order's number, products and special requests.
    actor KE as Kitchen employee
    participant OD as Order
    participant PR as Product
    participant RQ as Request

    %% covers 1, 2
    KE->>OD: view all orders with status
    %% covers 3, 5
    KE->>OD: view order number with its products
    OD->>PR: products of the order
    %% covers 4
    PR->>RQ: special requests
